{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>人民幣中間價終止連續四天的升勢。</p><p></p><p>官方開出的人民幣中間價報6.7195，較上個交易日下調3點子。現貨人民幣方面，在岸價和離岸價早段都於6.67水平上落。</p><p></p><p>另外，人民銀行開展1,730億元人民幣隔夜逆回購操作，扣除今日到期的逆回購，單日在市場淨投放480億元人民幣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T03:02:40.512732+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T02:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T03:18:03.882038+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T02:58:04.396137+00:00","content_hash":"e0c7f77c0a5a994cb401d09d6be592ede32300484584ba2f8ca62e94bf6ee87a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}